  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Education and Skills programme for economic Growth - YES4Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To deliver manifesto commitments on education and contribute to the global goal of inclusive and equitable quality education for all. To ensure underprivileged youth, especially females, have improved opportunities for basic education, vocational skills and formal employment. To contribute UK government&apos;s commitment to women&apos;s economic empowerment. To provide basic education and skills development training to over 27000 including 45% girls disadvantaged adolescents and youths.</narrative>
  </description>
